# Line endings are load-bearing here: the kit folder gets file-copied from any
# machine to any machine. A CRLF .sh breaks bash on Mac/Linux ("\r: command not
# found"); .bat/.ps1 are safest CRLF on Windows. Force both, regardless of the
# copying machine's git config.
*.sh  text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
